#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An introductory course on quantum chemistry using the variational quantum "
"eigensolver."
msgstr ""
"Isang panimulang kurso sa quantum chemistry gamit ang variational quantum "
"eigensolver."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-ideya"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-ideya {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-chem-with-vqe/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-chem-with-vqe/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Welcome to **Quantum chemistry with VQE**. The variational quantum "
"eigensolver (VQE) is a quantum algorithm with applications in quantum "
"chemistry and simulation. In this introductory course, you will learn the "
"basic building blocks of VQE, options in its implementation, and a few "
"applications. Content is delivered through a combination of text, video, and"
" code.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maligayang pagdating sa **Quantum chemistry with VQE**. Ang variational "
"quantum eigensolver (VQE) ay isang quantum algorithm na may mga aplikasyon "
"sa quantum chemistry at simulation. Sa panimulang kursong ito, matututunan "
"mo ang mga pangunahing bahagi ng VQE, ang mga pagpipilian sa pagpapatupad "
"nito, at ilang mga aplikasyon. Ang nilalaman ay ipinahahatid sa pamamagitan "
"ng kombinasyon ng teksto, video, at code.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Principle topics include:\n"
msgstr "Kasama sa mga pangunahing paksa:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Hamiltonians\n"
msgstr "Mga Hamiltonian\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Ansaetze\n"
msgstr "Mga Ansaetze\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Classical optimizers\n"
msgstr "Mga klasikal na optimizer\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Finding ground state energies using Qiskit patterns\n"
msgstr "Paghahanap ng ground state energies gamit ang mga Qiskit pattern\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Finding bond lengths using Qiskit patterns\n"
msgstr "Paghahanap ng bond lengths gamit ang mga Qiskit pattern\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course focuses on applications to quantum chemistry, though many of the"
" same building blocks (ansatz circuits, classical optimizers, and the Qiskit"
" patterns framework) can be applied to a wide range of fields outside "
"quantum chemistry.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang kursong ito ay nakatuon sa mga aplikasyon sa quantum chemistry, kahit na"
" marami sa mga parehong bahagi (ansatz circuits, classical optimizers, at "
"ang Qiskit patterns framework) ay maaaring ilapat sa malawak na hanay ng mga"
" larangan sa labas ng quantum chemistry.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Helpful resources {#helpful-resources}"
msgstr "Mga kapaki-pakinabang na mapagkukunan {#helpful-resources}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This introduction to VQE is designed for intermediate learners of quantum "
"computing techniques. No background in VQE is required. Familiarity with "
"Qiskit, and some familiarity with quantum mechanics and related mathematics "
"(such as operators) is assumed. We recommend devoting approximately 6-10 "
"hours to completing this content, depending on one's prior experience.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang panimulang ito sa VQE ay dinisenyo para sa mga intermediate na nag-aaral"
" ng mga teknik sa quantum computing. Hindi kinakailangan ang background sa "
"VQE. Ipinapalagay ang pagiging pamilyar sa Qiskit, at ilang kaalaman sa "
"quantum mechanics at kaugnay na matematika (tulad ng mga operator). "
"Inirerekomenda naming maglaan ng humigit-kumulang 6–10 oras para makumpleto "
"ang nilalaman na ito, depende sa naunang karanasan ng isa.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The course on [Basics of Quantum Information](/learning/courses/basics-of-"
"quantum-information/index) may be helpful in providing background and "
"fundamentals of quantum information and computing.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang kurso sa [Basics of Quantum Information](/learning/courses/basics-of-"
"quantum-information/index) ay maaaring makatulong sa pagbibigay ng "
"background at mga pundamental ng quantum information at computing.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Pagsusulit {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To earn your badge for Quantum Chemistry with VQE, take the exam at IBM&reg;"
" Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in "
"this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by Credly that "
"you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para makuha ang iyong badge para sa Quantum Chemistry with VQE, kumuha ng "
"pagsusulit sa IBM&reg; Training. Ang pagsusulit na ito ay nilayong gawin "
"pagkatapos basahin ang mga aralin sa kursong ito. Pagkatapos mong maipasa "
"ang pagsusulit, aabisuhan ka ng Credly na nakakuha ka ng badge.\n"

#. type: Plain text
